"3. ⟦CODE_0009⟧ marks ⟦CODE_0010⟧ as ⟦CODE_0011⟧ and exits 4. ⟦CODE_0012⟧ asks the inspector first, so it exits 4, prints that nothing was run and starts no tar. No ⟦CODE_0013⟧ appears. A plain ⟦CODE_0014⟧ writes ⟦CODE_0015⟧ as an inert file and runs nothing, because an archive cannot register a hook for itself. **Parsing** was done by ⟦CODE_0016⟧ and ⟦CODE_0017⟧ inside ⟦CODE_0018⟧, and by tar again inside ⟦CODE_0019⟧. **Running** happened only in ⟦CODE_0020⟧, in ⟦CODE_0021⟧. The trust boundary is the command line the operator typed."
